  {
    "udt_union_v0": {
      "doc": "Payload encoded inside the XlmEnvelope by the off-chain circuit + quorum.\\n\\nTwo variants:\\n\\n- `Rebalance` - read the blended pool's `query_delegate_state`, compare\\n`liquid_usdc / total_usdc` against the configured 50% target (where\\n`total_usdc = liquid + delegated` - the delegated portion is the\\nprincipal sitting in Blend, accounted as \"virtually in the pool\").\\nIf the drift exceeds `rebalance_band_bps`, move USDC between the pool's\\nliquid balance and Blend to restore the target. Skips if total USDC is\\nbelow `min_total_usdc`.\\n\\n- `HarvestYield` - extract accrued yield (BLND emissions + USDC interest\\nfrom b-token appreciation), convert to USDC, donate to LP holders\\npro-rata via `pool.donate(USDC, ...)`.\\n\\nNo amount/direction crosses the wire: the off-chain circuit only triggers\\na tick. All sizing happens on-chain against authoritative pool state.",
      "lib": "",
      "name": "RebalanceAction",
      "cases": [
        {
          "void_v0": {
            "doc": "",
            "name": "Rebalance"
          }
        },
        {
          "void_v0": {
            "doc": "",
            "name": "HarvestYield"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "udt_error_enum_v0": {
      "doc": "",
      "lib": "",
      "name": "LocalError",
      "cases": [
        {
          "doc": "`verify_xlm` invoked while the handler is paused. Operators should\\nnot retry until the dashboard shows `paused = false`.",
          "name": "Paused",
          "value": 600
        },
        {
          "doc": "Post-condition violation: the handler still holds USDC after an\\naction completed. Indicates a code bug that would otherwise leak\\nfunds; reverts the tx so the previous-state invariant is preserved.",
          "name": "UsdcLeak",
          "value": 601
        },
        {
          "doc": "`usdc_reserve_token_id` set to an even value. Blend's emissions\\ndistributor branches on parity (`% 2 == 1` is the supplier-side\\nb-token, `% 2 == 0` is the liability d-token); a wrong parity\\nsilently claims zero BLND for the supplier role forever.",
          "name": "InvalidReserveTokenId",
          "value": 602
        }
      ]
    }
  },
