    "udt_struct_v0": {
      "doc": "Mirror of Blend's `PoolConfig` struct (see\\n`blend-contracts-v2/pool/src/storage.rs::PoolConfig`). We only consume\\n`status` for the health pre-check; the other fields ride along to keep\\nthe contracttype wire shape compatible.\\n\\n`status` semantics (from `blend-contracts-v2/pool/src/pool/status.rs`):\\n- 0 / 1: Active / Admin-Active \\xe2\\x80\\x94 supply, withdraw, claim all allowed.\\n- 2 / 3: Admin-OnIce / OnIce \\xe2\\x80\\x94 withdraw + claim allowed; new supply blocked.\\n- 4 / 5: Admin-Frozen / Frozen \\xe2\\x80\\x94 all standard ops restricted.\\n- 6:     Setup \\xe2\\x80\\x94 not yet operational.",
